{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:43 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a19981451916d54a7d6629ee8376d88/2026-11/KF_LOGO.png\"/>\n<p>韓國天團 BIGBANG 正於啟德主場館舉行《BIGBANG 2026-2027 WORLD TOUR &lt; XX: COSMOS &gt; IN HONG KONG》演唱會，吸引到不少的名人觀賞，當中剛於第20屆亞洲運動會武術女子長拳決賽勇奪金牌的中國香港武術運動員沈曉榆。</p>\n<img alt=\"剛於第20屆亞洲運動會武術女子長拳決賽勇奪金牌的中國香港武術運動員沈曉榆以粉絲身份踏入「香港主場」。啟德體育園\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/480949e89d5173f6ad8510e6e239d568/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_50_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2474eb74917ec5e1663dfc35df092be4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_51_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f266c4893bd74af1b7b135337343b34b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_52_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8b192c178c7d67809323b30dff919c3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_51_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2d31558ba1b456d9070a2a7467678bb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_26_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fe1556ed7eafbcb214372c640cb9059/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_52_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94e64ed22bcd16f619d44f97393c0920/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_50_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/639756c2ba1debee6824cf17dbff9347/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_51_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/338aecb9b65e597904f621b316df8c91/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_53_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21a6a085f0c05b8dd99987cac39e9c12/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_5_24_52_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>沈曉榆今次以粉絲身份踏入「香港主場」率先於園區內多個巨型主題打卡裝置拍照留念。她表示，面對長期高強度的專業訓練，音樂一直是陪伴自己紓解壓力、放鬆心情的重要力量，今晚能夠近距離感受 BIGBANG 震撼的歌聲與舞台魅力，以及與全場歌迷一同投入這期待已久的演唱會，令她感到非常難忘。</p>\n<p>她又特別讚賞體育園貼心服務，其中包括多個行李寄存地點。沈曉榆指出，平日訓練行程緊湊，觀賞演唱會前難免需攜帶隨身物品，而體育園的行李寄存服務位置便利、操作簡單，免除攜帶大型行李的不便。她亦對體育園前線團隊的專業及親切態度讚賞有加，認為從安檢入場、座位引領以至各項細節安排均周到貼心。</p>\n<p>體育園分別於啟德體藝館1M層、啟德青年運動場外及啟德主場館跨境巴士上落客區提供行李寄存服務，部分地點更支援自助掃碼辦理。</p>\n<img alt=\"今晚演唱會情況。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43fa7e28a0c0ee62bf87566521971854/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_6_38_43_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f81a44a33ea3259c8a73dd8898e592d7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_6_38_43_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ba75b5a2e84c2b7ce337e34d651e051/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_6_38_44_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b84bc598ce0e8b6bdd272fd7866d1a9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_6_38_44_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e8d221164410e7c3201b94f936ed31dd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_6_38_45_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>圖片：啟德體育園、讀者提供</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:24:10.792438+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":516,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:43:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:38:37.476544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:39.485023+00:00","content_hash":"b2d6bb3bceae46f54491fa9412422217841c98d1eb3f15fcee96cc81fa2c3135","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}